      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T13:14:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should not use the mzxid of the object as that might introduce another race condition. E.g.\n\nEvents ZXIDs:\n\n1. create /foo\n2. create /bar\n3. modify /foo\n\nNow, if we start processing event 1. after 3. has already happened, we would set the max zxid to 3. without having processed event 2.",
      "revId": "9f8171d00ab20294c62458f05c8db40ac0580631",
